{"id":"diagram-revision-14e35595-5b77-43ee-bbb8-979bb18bbd07","diagramId":"diagram-c3147ca4-2769-4716-906f-9bf645629bc8","parentId":"diagram-revision-a5fa2c02-6a1b-49ca-af59-1cb2482eb524","diagram":{"id":"alt-central","revision":0,"diagramId":"diagram-c3147ca4-2769-4716-906f-9bf645629bc8","revisionId":"diagram-revision-14e35595-5b77-43ee-bbb8-979bb18bbd07","content":{"revisionId":"alt-central:0","ascii":"PLATFORM AND ECOSYSTEM | G1-G3 with G6 anchors\n[I] Bet: control the core; let partners extend merchant value.\nTime: FY2018-FY2025 evidence; no supplied 2026 observations.\n|\n|-- Core platform and extensibility\n|   |-- [S] BFCM 2023: 967,000 requests/second at peak.\n|   `-- [S] Mid-2024 Edition: unification; 150+ updates.\n|\n|-- App ecosystem\n|   |-- [R] Apps: ~2,500 (2018) -> >21,000 (2025).\n|   |-- [S] Built for Shopify launched 2023; >675 apps at FY2024.\n|   `-- [I] App count alone cannot establish app quality.\n|\n|-- Developer economics: 2021 revenue-share cut\n|   |-- [R] Zero share on first $1M of annual app/theme developer earnings.\n|   |-- [S] Q3 2021 revenue impact: about -$11M.\n|   `-- Cut -[D:assoc]-> developer activity; no causal estimate.\n|\n|-- Partners and referrals\n|   |-- [R] Referrers: ~18,000 (2018) -> >40,000 (2021).\n|   |-- Partners -[D:claim]-> merchant growth.\n|   `-- Merchant growth -[D:claim]-> more partners.\n|\n|-- Enterprise and systems partners\n|   |-- [S] Systems integrators refer business; Oracle deal in 2024.\n|   `-- Integrators -[D:claim]-> enterprise adoption.\n|\n|-- Commerce partners on Shopify's rails\n|   |-- [S] Amazon / Adyen (2023); PayPal / Klarna (2024).\n|   |-- [S] Roblox, YouTube Shopping, Perplexity moves in 2024.\n|   `-- [I] Build-versus-partner choices differ across capabilities.\n|\n|-- Strategic stakes and partnership economics\n|   |-- [R] Affirm / Global-E stakes began as non-cash consideration.\n|   |-- [R] FY2025 values: Affirm $1,511M; Global-E $868M; Klaviyo $599M.\n|   |-- Stakes -[D:claim]-> strategic alignment and value.\n|   |-- [R] Non-cash revenue: $158M (FY2023) -> $49M (FY2025).\n|   `-- [R] Flexport has both an equity-method stake and separate notes.\n|\n`-- Reading earnings\n    |-- [R] Investment gains/(losses): +$853M (2024); -$316M (2025).\n    |-- [R] FY2025: operating income $1,468M; net income $1,231M.\n    `-- [I] Track operations separately; retain accounting caveats.\n|\n[I] Claimed ecosystem loop is not identified causal evidence.\n[I] Detail branches distinguish source-backed facts from seed gaps.","asciiSha256":"4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9","structure":{"kind":"diagram","parserVersion":"ascii-graph-1"}},"sourceContext":{"contentHash":"4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9","mappings":[],"evidence":{}},"jumps":[{"id":"jump-10","source":{"revisionId":"alt-central:0","contentHash":"4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9","line":38,"startColumn":13,"endColumn":20},"target":{"representationId":"representation-e1ae35f2-3251-4c82-82a1-2f2dea680dab","displayNodeId":"grid:alt-central","contentNodeId":"alt-central:0:9f8ab101839ab4ebb6f203c425806cad59f36e28e7bf49f484c8247447f8f81f:node-39-5"}}]},"nodeRefs":{"alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-1-1":"node-2c83b304-119d-4ad3-8688-cfaaa1e81ab7","alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-3-1":"node-6bde21af-a460-4e33-a42a-a66d5106f935","alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-5-5":"node-78a90ff4-428a-4646-b433-55d665fea3e5","alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-6-9":"node-0bef81cb-cbd5-4072-8488-e1be710cfba1","alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-7-9":"node-b345106b-6e7b-4a27-8ea7-462fc16f0470","alt-central:0:4f8000a68902987697cd9d4fce1967d01ffdec64812ad5926dd0c4a8c4fd9ce9:node-9-5":"